                    <chunk name="param_input" index="4">
                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Where the LiDAR comes from. Auto: AHN inside the Netherlands, swissSURFACE3D, Bavaria, IGN LiDAR HD, Scotland's National LiDAR Programme, Estonia, Denmark, Slovenia or Spain's PNOA where the site lies in one, else USGS 3DEP (its newest project over the site). Browse… picks one dataset: "3DEP &lt;project&gt;" reads that project, "AHN &lt;sheet&gt;" reads AHN. Or type an http(s) URL of any LAS/LAZ file (metric coordinates): it is downloaded once into the cache and cropped around Cloud Centre.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">f9ea65e7-d42f-40c7-98d7-b7f53b6fc4a4</item>
                        <item name="Multiple" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
