                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Aerodynamic roughness length z0 [m] per layer outline (by index, the last repeats), carried to the Layer Roughness output — one value per Layers mesh, for Ground Roughness. LiDAR Site's Layer Roughness output.</item>
