                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Watch a FluidX3D wind solve live in the viewport: colors an analysis mesh with the velocity magnitude of the newest exported frame while the GPU solver runs, updating as each frame lands. Also shows the final field of a completed run.

Wire either the Run component's Case or Folder output into Case, and supply the mesh to read the wind on (e.g. a pedestrian-level plane).

