                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Build a lattice-Boltzmann wind case from the ABL, the geometry and a settings object, and write it to disk. Wire 'LBM Run Settings' for OpenLB or 'FluidX3D Run Settings' for FluidX3D (nothing = OpenLB). Feed the Case output to LBM Run, then to Probe, LBM Field or FluidX3D Live View — the same Case → Run → Probe chain as the OpenFOAM wind study.

