                        <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="Options" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">OneBuilding (nearest TMYx)
EnergyPlus (nearest)
Open-Meteo (ERA5)
Open-Meteo (IFS 9 km)
Open-Meteo (CERRA 5 km)
Open-Meteo (ICON-D2 2 km)
Open-Meteo (HRRR 3 km)
Open-Meteo (ERA5 + satellite radiation)
PVGIS (typical year)
NASA POWER (MERRA-2 + CERES)
ERA5 via Copernicus CDS
NSRDB (GOES TMY, PSM v4)
NSRDB (GOES aggregated, PSM v4)
USA_WI_Volk.Field.ANGB.726436_TMYx</item>
