                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Stop the run early once its running average has settled: the change of the probe-layer mean between consecutive snapshots (mean |du| in % of the mean speed) at or under this value for two snapshots in a row. 0 = run the whole averaging window; 3 is a sensible value, and the window then stays the upper bound. Single runs only (an ensemble's members solve one after another).</item>
